# ENV twice: RACK at ENV4. ALGORITHM opens the kind picker on Chance; a
# second later it commits, and the default cable RTRG > ENV4 GATE switches
# off. ALGORITHM back to Envelope, and HOME commits that at once: the new
# envelope gets its cable back.
--button 0.05:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.10:ENV
--button 0.15:ENV
--turn 0.20:ALGORITHM:1
--turn 1.30:ALGORITHM:-1
--button 1.60:HOME
